Z||000029||olympic||02-01-2001||05:51 AM||||  On tuesday I drove about 240 miles to pick up an 89 Taurus SHO parts car.  It was a small town of about 1000 people.  The owner of the SHO ran a parts store/body shop and as I walked through the building I looked way to the back and there was a Lamborghini Countach sitting there!!  I immediately thought it was a kit car.  The owner said "Nope, she's real.  Its an 1983"  He even opened the vertical doors and showed me the V12 in the back too.  It was in perfect condition and only had 15000 km.   It was for sale too.....only $95k...lol.  An '83 Countach may not be too impressive to many people but believe me, out here in Saskatchewan I've never seen another one.  I didn't even think there was one in the whole province!!||||reg||1
Z||000030||TheFiero64||02-01-2001||03:47 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hugh:<BR><B>Josh,Have you any more pictures?That car is awesome.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>His web page is <A HREF="http://www.boomtastic.com" TARGET=_blank>www.boomtastic.com</A> <P>Check it out<BR><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>88 Coupe V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
Z||000031||Pontiaddict||02-01-2001||11:49 PM||||I used to mow grass for a rest area that sat between the north and south lanes of the highway, so I usually got a good look at the cars going either way.<P>The ones I can remember are.<P>A BMW M roadster (weird but cool)<P>About every Corvette ever made going up north for a show.<P>An early 80's Camaro done up like a Michigan State Police car. I don't think that it was really a police interceptor though, probably just a repo'd drug dealers car.<P>The Neimahn(sp) Marcus new Ford T-bird that one of the car mags got ahold of before anyone else. (UGLY!)<P>I've also seen a few Deloreans though not while I was at work. One was unpainted, one was blue and one was green(yuk). But not all together, that would just be weird.||||reg||1
